{"id":"4019652003538248121","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Our school does a really neat Halloween concert every year in conjunction with our town's Spook the Loop party. The middle school and high school each play ONE SONG. The entire thing is half an hour. There is NO excuse for anyone leaving early. The band kids also hand out treats at the end for all the kids who came in their costumes. The whole point is to get the young kids interested in music, why are we robbing them of seeing how awesome it is when you stick with it into high school?","username":"sarajost07","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@sarajost07/post/DfIrDM_laG5","timestamp":"2026-10-30T22:38:01Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-30T23:10:48.159912821Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-30T23:10:54.283222Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-30T23:10:54.283222Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_54a428760a5272aa","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
